Package: volvelle
Type: Package
Title: Config-Driven ROLLUP Aggregation with Interactive Drill-Down Widget
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("volvelle", "Authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "volvelle@example.com")
  )
Description: Provides a configuration-driven ROLLUP aggregation framework that
    accepts a data frame and a YAML config file declaring a column hierarchy,
    measure definitions, optional named filters, and optional derived
    (post-aggregation) fields. Returns structured, nested aggregations via
    data.table groupingsets(), and wraps results in a self-contained HTML
    drill-down widget for use in R Markdown reports and Shiny applications.
    The name references the medieval rotating paper calculation instrument —
    nested analytical layers, each a distinct face or facet of the data.
